survey series was the only one sampled in some years. These years are
kept in the refit as \code{extra_time}, so that the random fields stay defined
and the warm start remains valid, and their index values are reported as
\code{NA}. A formula with a factor year effect cannot be estimated for such
years; use a smooth or random-field-only temporal structure, or expect
those refits to fail. Likewise, if \code{newdata} predicts for a level of a
